{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Tilt-Shift 是一款把照片與影片轉化成微縮模型風格畫面的攝影 App，適合喜歡城市街景、風景、建築與日常題材的用戶。它提供即時移軸效果預覽，拍攝時已能看到成品感覺，亦可為相簿照片加上微縮效果。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，適合想嘗試特別視覺效果的攝影愛好者。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-88.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>即時拍攝與微縮效果</h2>\n<p>即時拍攝相機可在拍攝照片或錄製有聲影片前預覽移軸效果，並快速切換模式。用戶可移動及調整對焦帶角度，微調模糊強度、對焦寬度、飽和度與亮度；支援多種構圖比例、變焦與雙指縮放。點按主體可設定對焦與測光，亦可調校曝光。相簿照片可套用微縮效果，完成後可儲存至 Photos 或分享影片。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-105-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-106-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-107-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-108-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Tilt-Shift</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/tilt-shift/id6757347597?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T07:20:47.846498+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":339,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T07:04:40+00:00",